{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"那份亲近仍像远处的旧歌，熟悉得牵动他，却不能像从前那样自然拥有。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M17\", \"M18\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已知道重新亲近不能让过去复原，而那份在意又没有散去；眼下只能认真承认自己仍然珍惜着。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M17\", \"M23\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他于是把自己挺直，生出庄严和一点骄傲，像终于能够正面承受这份在意。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M8\", \"M9\", \"M15\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不再把等待它自行散去当作办法，便用克制把自己收拢；这确实稳住了姿态。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M8\", \"M9\", \"M23\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"可这份挺直开始变得费力，他一遍遍催自己撑住，激动也渐渐急促，末尾仍悬着。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M22\", \"M33\", \"M34\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"克制只压住了动摇，没有让过去复原；反复把自己绷紧先耗掉力气，牵挂仍留在原处。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M4\", \"M22\", \"M24\", \"M34\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，即使过去不能复原，庄重和克制仍能让他正面承受眼下的在意。\",\n    \"他开始察觉，这种站立不是自然的安稳，而需要反复用力维持，不能因此让过去回来。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5\",\n      \"why\": \"这股激昂也可能出于不甘心就此消亡，但前后变化同样支持自我控制，尚不足以确认他另有一股反抗动机。主线采用自持的解释，不把两种心理机制拼成确定剧情。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6cc257eb-6caa-4b3e-945e-80b55deafa59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T231349811988Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:15:29.099250+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e896599ff7c2bc5745e8d741fd3f6afe165f698e847191784e67088c5354a3c3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T231349811988Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1184431ece63f75415af082a002054bacd2a56f2c547ed02010a97dcfb2e6e2a"}}}
